\u0159ihla\u0161ovac\u00edho jm\u00e9na). Pravidla pro u\u017eivatele a opr\u00e1vn\u011bn\u00ed plat\u00ed nav\u00edc k omezen\u00edm rol\u00ed v\u00fd\u0161e. U\u017eivatel\u00e9, kte\u0159\u00ed sm\u011bj\u00ed spravovat nastaven\u00ed, v\u017edy zachovaj\u00ed UX Studio, Pluginy, U\u017eivatele a Nastaven\u00ed. Kdy\u017e je zapnut\u00e9 \u201eZablokovat p\u0159\u00edstup ke skryt\u00fdm str\u00e1nk\u00e1m\u201c, skryt\u00e9 podpolo\u017eky se odm\u00edtnou i po zad\u00e1n\u00ed adresy."],"The item itself":["Samotn\u00e1 polo\u017eka"],"Rename":["P\u0159ejmenovat"],"New title of %s":["Nov\u00fd n\u00e1zev polo\u017eky %s"],"Move %s under":["P\u0159esunout %s pod"],"(stays here)":["(z\u016fst\u00e1v\u00e1 tady)"],"Hidden for roles":["Skryto pro role"],"Nobody":["Nikdo"],"User logins, separated by commas.":["P\u0159ihla\u0161ovac\u00ed jm\u00e9na u\u017eivatel\u016f, odd\u011blen\u00e1 \u010d\u00e1rkami."],"Renamed to %s":["P\u0159ejmenov\u00e1no na %s"],"moved under %s":["p\u0159esunuto pod %s"],"hidden for everybody":["skryto pro v\u0161echny"],"hidden for %s":["skryto pro %s"],"needs %s":["vy\u017eaduje %s"],"always shown to: %s":["v\u017edy zobrazeno: %s"],"never shown to: %s":["nikdy zobrazeno: %s"],"No changes":["Beze zm\u011bn"],"Move %s up":["Posunout %s nahoru"],"Move %s down":["Posunout %s dol\u016f"]}}}